    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d14">

                <pb facs="0148" n="114" xml:id="pg114"/>

                <head>14. Memorandum From the Acting Executive Secretary of the National Security
                    Council (Gleason) to the National Security Council<anchor n="1" xml:id="d14-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1956-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                        1956</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>U.S. Policy Toward Latin America</item>
                </list>
                <list type="references">
                    <head>REFERENCES</head>
                    <item>A. NSC 5613</item>
                    <item>B. NSC Action No. 1601–b–(4)</item>
                </list>
                <p>The enclosed draft revision of paragraphs 14, 32, 34–b and 35 of NSC 5613,
                    prepared by the NSC Planning Board pursuant to NSC Action No. 1601–b–(4), is
                    transmitted herewith for consideration by the National Security Council at its
                    meeting on Thursday, September 20, 1956.</p>
                <p>The enclosed draft includes, also for consideration by the Council at its meeting
                    on September 20, a draft revision of paragraphs 22 and 34–a of NSC 5613,
                    prepared and recommended by the NSC Planning Board.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">S. Everett Gleason</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d14-a1.xml" xpointer="d14-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
